{"title":"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is defined for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. For all non-zero values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58dd6786465c69dee17d327eff425fb3ee818169.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2f\\left(x\\right) + f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) = 5x + 4\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> denote the sum of all of the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/a/86aa628839f05b93af690d2a60316d4057d719e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 2004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. Compute the integer nearest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a0901419c277658469226431138dfb5ede474b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"37\" />, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcbf997ecb340d64585b224dc7bf6669fc28d8b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2f\\left(\\frac 1x\\right) + f\\left(x\\right) = \\frac{5}{x} + 4\\]\" width=\"193\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>This gives us two equations, which we can eliminate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/985e78434fd5ab83092d1d53856a9264307f68c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac 1x\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"51\" height=\"43\" /> from (the first equation multiplied by two, subtracting the second):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b117d57d669aa0dab5da717d526dd9fce61e627.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 3f(x) &amp;= 10x + 4 - \\frac 5x \\\\ 0 &amp;= x^2 - \\frac{3 \\times 2004 - 4}{10}x + \\frac 52\\end{align*}\" width=\"255\" height=\"81\" />\n</p><p>Clearly, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discriminant\" title=\"Discriminant\">discriminant</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">quadratic equation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/06521e2821abce29832148c56843a25fa1c02684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />, so both roots are real. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>, the sum of the roots is the coefficient of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> term, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3b549b1fdac0de532e6832e2cafca5e47466487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[\\frac{3 \\times 2004 - 4}{10}\\right] = \\boxed{601}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"185\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017124416\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 147/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1429/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 175/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2843/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.365      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.365      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4662:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017124416 and revision id 46059. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}